    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29920" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">multĭplĭcātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				making manifold, increasing, multiplying</i> (postAug.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frugum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					3, 2, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quinariarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Front. Aquaed. 34</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">temporum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 12, 6</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			partic., <i>multiplication</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 5, 2,
			1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vitr. 9, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">10, 16</span></i>.</div>
